      "observation": {
        "url": "https://paolinocapri.com/en/prenota-un-tavolo/",
        "title": "Prenota un tavolo – Da Paolino",
        "text": "HOME\nHISTORY\nCASA PAOLINO\nPRESS\nEVENTS\nBOOK A TABLE\nBook a table\nCHOOSE WHICH OF THE TWO RESTAURANTS YOU WOULD LIKE TO BOOK\nPaolino Lemontress\n\nPaolino Lemontrees is already open\n\nSince 1976, the original lemon garden—famous all over the world—has preserved and passed down the true Caprese tradition.\n\nCasa Paolino\n\nCasa Paolino is already open\n\nJust steps away from the island’s center, Casa Paolino comes to life: a new restaurant born from the desire to reinterpret tradition in a more modern and intimate way. By Paolino Lemontrees Capri®\n\nSee All Availability\n\nDiscover available dates for Paolino Lemontrees and Casa Paolino, and find the atmosphere that best suits your moment.\n\nPaolino Lemontrees – Via Palazzo a Mare, 11, 80073 Capri NA\n\n\nView Larger Map\n\nCasa Paolino – Via Campo di Teste 4, 80073 Capri NA\n\n\nView Larger Map\n\n \n\nFor Private Events\nevents@paolinocapri.com\n\n(only for events requests)\n\nDress Code: Elegant – Casual\nNo Flip Flop\nNo Tank Top Men\n\nInstagram\n \nFacebook\n \nTripadvisor\n\n2025 · DA PAOLINO RESTAURANT - DESIGN BY INTO THE NET\n\nLa società PAOLINO SRL, PARTITA IVA 06527251216, ha ricevuto nel corso del 2024 aiuti di stato pubblicati sul RNA – sezione Trasparenza\n\nEnglish\nNotice\n\nWe and selected third parties use cookies or similar technologies for technical purposes and, with your consent, for functionality, experience and “marketing (personalised ads)” as specified in the cookie policy.\n\nYou can freely give, deny, or withdraw your consent at any time by accessing the preferences panel. Denying consent may make related features unavailable.\n\nUse the “Accept” button to consent. Use the “Reject” button to continue without accepting.\n\nLearn more and customise\nReject\nAccept",
